,\"10\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"Premium Motorcycle accessories and performance upgrades\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://iranimotohub.in/hero-bg.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"12\",{\"rel\":\"shortcut icon\",\"href\":\"/imhlogo.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"13\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico?favicon.1-ypg-tqme8hc.ico\",\"sizes\":\"1024x1024\",\"type\":\"image/x-icon\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"14\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/imhlogo.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"15\",{\"rel\":\"apple-touch-icon\",\"href\":\"/imhlogo.png\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2c\",\"16\",{}]]\n2d:I[12371,[\"/_next/static/chunks/2wh3bu9ub4p8d.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2bmv3ihep17gq.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3cichi1mg1ftc.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3whgfyvaz15fw.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0q6ibp_bkaa1-.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3j-4ruzks89pv.js\"],\"default\"]\n2e:T6ca,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION : Take your bike’s protection to the next level with the MotoCare Upper Lower Crash Guard with Sliders for Suzuki V-Strom 250, built for both adventure and city riding. This premium crash guard is engineered to provide complete upper and lower body protection, safeguarding critical components like the engine, radiator, and fairings. The integrated impact-resistant sliders help absorb shocks during falls or collisions, minimizing potential damage. Constructed using heavy-duty, high-quality metal, the guard is designed to withstand harsh riding conditions, whether you're tackling off-road trails or daily urban commutes. The corrosion-resistant powder-coated finish ensures long-lasting durability while enhancing your bike’s rugged appeal. Available in two striking color variants – Red and Silver, this crash guard not only boosts safety but also elevates your bike’s overall aesthetics. Its precision-engineered fitment ensures seamless integration with the V-Strom 250’s frame without affecting performance or balance. With an easy bolt-on installation, you can upgrade your bike quickly and ride with confidence knowing you’re fully protected. PRODUCT FEATURES : Bike-Specific Design – Perfect fit for Suzuki V-Strom 250 Upper & Lower Protection – Full coverage for engine and body Integrated Sliders – Reduces impact damage during falls Heavy-Duty Construction – Built for off-road & touring durability Corrosion Resistant Coating – Long-lasting performance Premium Finish – Available in Red & Silver variants Easy Installation – Direct bolt-on, no modification required Adventure Ready – Ideal for touring and rough terrains Compatibility : Suzuki V-Strom 250 – ✅ Direct Fit2f:T637,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION : Maximize your bike’s protection with the Motocare Upper Lower Crash Guard for Suzuki V-Strom SX 250, designed for complete coverage and rugged performance. This full-body crash guard system protects both the upper and lower sections of your motorcycle, ensuring critical components like the engine, tank, and frame remain safe during falls or impacts. Whether you're riding through city traffic or tackling off-road terrain, it offers comprehensive protection and peace of mind. Crafted from high-quality, heavy-duty materials, the guard is built to handle extreme conditions and impacts. The black powder-coated finish adds superior corrosion resistance while enhancing the aggressive styling of your V-Strom SX 250. Engineered with a precision bike-specific design, it integrates seamlessly with your bike’s frame without affecting balance or aerodynamics. The easy bolt-on installation ensures quick setup without complex modifications. Perfect for touring and adventure riders, this crash guard delivers maximum safety, durability, and bold styling. PRODUCT FEATURES : Bike-Specific Fit – Designed for Suzuki V-Strom SX 250 Upper + Lower Protection – Full coverage crash guard Heavy-Duty Construction – Strong and impact-resistant Engine, Tank & Frame Protection – Safeguards critical parts Powder-Coated Finish – Corrosion and weather resistant Adventure Ready Design – Ideal for touring & off-road Easy Installation – Direct bolt-on fitment Aggressive Styling – Enhances bike appearance Compatibility : Suzuki V-Strom SX 250 – ✅ Direct Fit30:T50d,🔹 Product Description : Upgrade your bike’s safety and style with the MotoCare Upper Lower Crash Guard (White), exclusively designed for the Hero XPulse 210. Built for riders who demand maximum protection, this crash guard offers full upper and lower coverage for the engine, frame, and exhaust system. Engineered using high-strength materials, it delivers superior impact resistance against falls, collisions, and rough terrain damage. Whether you're riding through city traffic or exploring off-road trails, it ensures your bike remains protected in all conditions. The precision-fit design integrates seamlessly with the XPulse 210 frame, allowing hassle-free installation without modifications. Its white powder-coated finish not only enhances corrosion resistance but also adds a clean, premium, and standout look to your motorcycle. Perfect for touring, adventure, and daily commuting—this crash guard is a must-have safety upgrade for every XPulse rider. 🔹 Product Features : ✅ Custom-fit for Hero XPulse 210 ✅ Dual upper & lower crash protection ✅ Heavy-duty impact-resistant construction ✅ Protects engine, frame & exhaust system ✅ Premium white powder-coated finish ✅ Rust & corrosion resistant ✅ Easy bolt-on installation ✅ Ideal for off-road & touring use31:T539,🔹 Product Description : Protect your ride with the MotoCare Upper Lower Crash Guard (Silver), designed exclusively for the Hero XPulse 210. Engineered for maximum safety, this premium crash guard provides full upper and lower protection to your bike’s engine, frame, and exhaust system. Built from high-strength materials, it delivers exceptional durability and impact resistance, ensuring your motorcycle stays protected during off-road rides, city traffic, or unexpected falls. Its dual-section design offers comprehensive coverage, reducing damage in critical areas during collisions or rough terrain impacts. The precision-fit structure integrates seamlessly with the XPulse 210 frame, ensuring easy installation without modifications. The silver powder-coated finish enhances corrosion resistance while giving your bike a bold, rugged, and premium look. Whether you're touring long distances or navigating urban roads, this crash guard offers the perfect balance of protection, durability, and style. 🔹 Product Features : ✅ Custom-fit for Hero XPulse 210 ✅ Dual upper & lower crash protection ✅ Heavy-duty impact-resistant construction ✅ Protects engine, frame & exhaust ✅ Silver powder-coated anti-rust finish ✅ Rugged adventure-ready design ✅ Easy bolt-on installation ✅ Ideal for touring & off-road riding32:T4ff,🔹 Product Description : Enhance your bike’s safety and style with the MotoCare Upper Lower Crash Guard (Red), specially designed for the Hero XPulse 210. Built for riders who demand maximum protection, this crash guard provides complete upper and lower coverage for the engine, frame, and exhaust system. Made from high-strength materials, it offers excellent impact resistance against falls, collisions, and rough terrain damage. Whether you're riding in city traffic or exploring off-road trails, it ensures your motorcycle stays protected in all conditions. The precision-engineered design guarantees a perfect fit for the XPulse 210 without requiring modifications. Its vibrant red powder-coated finish adds a bold, sporty, and aggressive adventure-ready look while resisting rust and corrosion. Ideal for touring, daily commuting, and off-road adventures, this crash guard delivers the perfect combination of protection, durability, and style. 🔹 Product Features : ✅ Custom-fit for Hero XPulse 210 ✅ Dual upper & lower crash protection ✅ Heavy-duty impact-resistant construction ✅ Protects engine, frame & exhaust system ✅ Premium red powder-coated finish ✅ Rust & corrosion resistant ✅ Easy bolt-on installation ✅ Ideal for touring & off-road riding33:T4f5,🔹 Product Description : Enhance your bike’s protection with the MotoCare Upper Lower Crash Guard (Black), specially designed for the Hero XPulse 210. Built for riders who demand maximum safety and durability, this crash guard provides full upper and lower protection for the engine, frame, and exhaust system. Crafted from high-strength materials, it delivers superior impact resistance against falls, collisions, and rough terrain damage. Whether you're riding in city traffic or exploring off-road trails, this guard ensures your bike stays protected in all conditions. The precision-engineered design offers a perfect fit for the XPulse 210 without requiring modifications. Its black powder-coated finish enhances corrosion resistance while giving your bike a bold, aggressive, and premium adventure look. Ideal for touring, off-road riding, and daily commuting, this crash guard is a must-have safety upgrade for every XPulse rider. 🔹 Product Features : ✅ Custom-fit for Hero XPulse 210 ✅ Dual upper & lower crash protection ✅ Heavy-duty impact-resistant construction ✅ Protects engine, frame & exhaust system ✅ Premium black powder-coated finish ✅ Rust & corrosion resistant ✅ Easy bolt-on installation ✅ Ideal for touring & off-road riding34:T67b,📝 Product Description : Protect your motorcycle’s most critical components with the MotoCare Upper Crash Guard for 2025 KTM Adventure 250 & 390, engineered for riders who demand maximum safety, durability, and adventure-ready performance. This premium upper crash guard is designed to safeguard your bike’s engine, handlebars, and upper frame during accidental falls, off-road impacts, or rough terrain riding. It provides superior protection while maintaining full riding stability and control. Built from high-strength, corrosion-resistant materials, this crash guard is designed to withstand extreme riding conditions, including long-distance touring, off-road trails, and daily commuting. Its impact-absorbing structure helps distribute crash forces effectively, reducing damage to your motorcycle. The precision-fit design ensures seamless compatibility with the KTM Adventure 250/390, offering OEM-level integration without affecting bike handling. Its rugged yet stylish design enhances your bike’s aggressive adventure look. Easy bolt-on installation ensures a hassle-free upgrade with no modifications required. 🔥 Product Features : ✔️ Compatible with 2025 KTM Adventure 250 & 390 ✔️ Heavy-duty upper crash protection system ✔️ Protects engine, handlebars & upper frame ✔️ Impact absorption & force distribution design ✔️ High-strength corrosion-resistant construction ✔️ Precision OEM-style bike-specific fit ✔️ Ideal for touring, off-road & adventure riding ✔️ Enhances rugged motorcycle aesthetics ✔️ Easy bolt-on installation (no modification required) ✔️ Maximum rider safety & bike protection35:T53c,✅ PRODUCT DESCRIPTION : Protect your adventure machine with the premium **MotoCare Upper Lower Crash Guard for **. Designed specifically for the RTX 300, this heavy-duty crash guard provides superior protection to both upper and lower engine sections during off-road rides, touring, and daily commuting. Manufactured using high-strength metal construction, this crash guard ensures maximum impact resistance while maintaining structural integrity. The black powder-coated finish enhances corrosion resistance and adds a bold, aggressive look that perfectly complements the adventure styling of the RTX 300. Engineered for precise fitment, the guard aligns seamlessly with the bike’s frame without affecting aerodynamics or ride balance. Whether tackling rugged terrains or city roads, this crash guard ensures your motorcycle remains protected and road-ready. Ride safer. Ride stronger. Ride protected. ✅ PRODUCT FEATURES : ✔ Compatible with TVS Apache RTX 300 ✔ Upper & Lower Dual Protection Design ✔ Heavy-Duty High-Strength Metal Construction ✔ Black Powder-Coated for Rust Resistance ✔ Engine & Fairing Impact Protection ✔ Perfect Frame Alignment & OE Fitment ✔ Suitable for Touring & Off-Road Riding ✔ Enhances Aggressive Adventure Look ✔ Corrosion & Weather Resistant ✔ Easy Installation with Secure Mounting36:T545,✅ Product Description : Protect your adventure motorcycle with the Motocare Upper & Lower Crash Guard for KTM Adventure 250 & 390—a premium heavy-duty protection system designed for serious off-road and touring riders. Engineered for maximum safety, this crash guard provides full upper and lower engine protection, shielding your bike’s frame, engine, and exhaust from damage during falls, collisions, or rough terrain impacts. Whether you're exploring off-road trails or riding in urban traffic, it ensures complete peace of mind. Built with high-strength materials and finished in a premium orange powder-coated layer, it not only delivers superior corrosion resistance but also enhances your bike’s aggressive adventure styling. Its precision-fit design ensures seamless installation and perfect integration with KTM Adventure geometry, without affecting aerodynamics or ride performance. ✅ Key Product Features : ✔ Custom fit for KTM Adventure 250 & 390 ✔ Full upper & lower crash protection system ✔ Heavy-duty construction for extreme durability ✔ Protects engine, frame & exhaust components ✔ Orange powder-coated anti-rust finish ✔ Designed for off-road & touring safety ✔ Absorbs impact during falls & collisions ✔ Enhances rugged adventure bike aesthetics ✔ Easy bolt-on installation (no modification required)37:T570,✅ Product Description : Protect your motorcycle with the MotoCare Upper & Lower Crash Guard for KTM Adventure 250 & 390—a premium heavy-duty protection system designed for serious adventure and touring riders. Engineered for maximum durability, this crash guard provides full upper and lower protection for your bike’s engine, frame, and exhaust system. It is designed to absorb impact during falls, off-road rides, or unexpected collisions, ensuring your motorcycle stays protected in all conditions. Built from high-strength materials with a corrosion-resistant black powder-coated finish, it delivers long-lasting durability while enhancing your KTM Adventure’s aggressive styling. The precision-fit design ensures seamless integration with the bike’s chassis, maintaining aerodynamics and ride stability without compromise. Whether you're touring highways or tackling rough terrain, this crash guard is built to perform . ✅ Key Product Features : ✔ Custom fit for KTM Adventure 250 & 390 ✔ Full upper & lower crash protection system ✔ Protects engine, frame & exhaust components ✔ Heavy-duty metal construction for maximum durability ✔ Absorbs impact during falls & collisions ✔ Rust-resistant black powder-coated finish ✔ Ideal for off-road & touring conditions ✔ Enhances rugged adventure bike styling ✔ Easy bolt-on installation (no modification required)38:T591,🔹 PRODUCT DESCRIPTION : Upgrade your motorcycle’s protection with the MotoCare Upper & Lower Crash Guard, precision-engineered for the Honda CB200X. Designed for maximum safety and durability, this crash guard offers complete protection for both upper and lower sections of your bike. Built from high-strength materials, it acts as a protective shield for the engine, frame, and exhaust during falls, impacts, or rough riding conditions. Whether you’re riding in the city or exploring off-road terrain, this crash guard ensures your motorcycle stays protected from costly damage. The dual-level protection system with upper and lower bars provides extended coverage, making it ideal for adventure riders. Its corrosion-resistant powder-coated finish enhances durability while giving your bike a bold and rugged appearance. With a bike-specific design, it ensures perfect fitment without affecting performance or balance. Easy installation makes it a practical upgrade for riders who want safety, style, and confidence on every ride. 🔹 PRODUCT FEATURES :