lessly integrates with your Classic 350 while maintaining its iconic look. With corrosion-resistant coating and heavy-duty construction, it ensures long-lasting performance in all weather conditions. ✅ 🔹 Key Features : ✔️ 16 Gauge Heavy-Duty Steel – Maximum durability & impact resistance✔️ Diamond Pattern Design – Enhanced strength & stylish appearance✔️ Integrated Rope Protection – Shock absorption & improved control✔️ Engine & Body Protection – Shields vital components from damage✔️ Perfect Fit for Classic 350 – Precision-engineered compatibility✔️ Corrosion-Resistant Finish – Built for all weather conditions✔️ Easy Installation – Includes all mounting hardware67:T527,✅ Product Description : Protect your bike like a pro with the Motocare Crash Guard with Dual Sliders (Orange) for KTM Duke 250/390 Gen 3. Designed for maximum safety and durability, this heavy-duty crash guard shields critical components like the engine and frame during falls or impacts. Equipped with dual sliders for enhanced protection, this accessory minimizes damage while maintaining your bike’s aggressive look with its bold orange finish. Whether you're riding in the city or pushing limits on highways, this crash guard ensures peace of mind and long-term protection. 🚀 Why Choose Motocare Crash Guard? Bike-Specific Fit: Precision-designed for KTM Duke 250 & 390 Gen 3 Dual Slider Protection: Extra safety for engine and frame Heavy-Duty Build: High-strength construction for impact resistance Corrosion Resistant: Long-lasting finish for all weather conditions Stylish Upgrade: Enhances bike aesthetics with sporty design Ride confidently knowing your bike is protected in every situation. ✅ Product Features : Crash guard with dual frame sliders Protects engine and key components Absorbs impact during falls or crashes Strong and durable metal construction Rust-resistant premium coating Precision mounting points for stability Easy installation (direct fit) Enhances rugged and sporty appearance68:T742,Product Description: • 🏍️ Protect your Yamaha XSR 155 with the premium Motocare Crash Guard with Dual Sliders, engineered to provide maximum protection to the engine and frame during accidental drops or minor crashes. • 🛡️ Designed with dual protective sliders, this crash guard helps absorb impact and minimize damage to critical motorcycle components such as the engine casing, chassis, and side panels. • ⚙️ Built using high-strength heavy duty steel, the crash guard offers superior durability and stability, making it an ideal safety upgrade for daily commuters and touring riders. • 🔧 The bike-specific design ensures perfect fitment on the Yamaha XSR 155 without requiring any modification, maintaining the original structure and balance of the motorcycle. • 🎯 The premium powder-coated finish enhances corrosion resistance and gives the motorcycle a rugged, stylish look that complements the retro-modern design of the XSR 155. • 🚀 Whether you ride in the city or go on long rides, this crash guard adds extra safety, durability, and confidence on every journey. Product Features: • 🛡️ Dual Impact Sliders – Extra protection for the engine and frame during accidental drops. • 🔩 Heavy Duty Steel Construction – Strong and durable build for long-lasting protection. • ⚙️ Bike Specific Mounting – Designed precisely for Yamaha XSR 155. • 🧩 Perfect Fitment – Direct bolt-on installation with no modifications required. • 🏍️ Enhanced Engine Safety – Protects engine casing and surrounding components. • 🛠️ Premium Powder Coating – Rust-resistant and scratch-resistant finish. • 🎯 Stylish & Functional Design – Complements the aggressive and retro styling of the XSR 155. • 🚀 Ideal for Touring & Daily Riding – Provides extra safety for all types of riders.69:T669,Product Description : Protect your bike with confidence using the Motocare Crash Guard with Dual Sliders for Yamaha R15 V4, a premium safety accessory designed to minimize damage during falls, crashes, or unexpected impacts. Engineered for maximum protection, this crash guard ensures your bike’s engine, frame, and fairings stay safe on every ride. Featuring a bike-specific precision design, it integrates seamlessly with the Yamaha R15 V4, maintaining the sporty look while adding robust protection. The dual slider system is strategically positioned to absorb and disperse impact force, reducing damage to critical components. Built from high-strength, heavy-duty materials, this crash guard is designed to withstand harsh riding conditions and long-term use. Its corrosion-resistant premium finish ensures durability and protection against weather elements. With easy bolt-on installation, riders can quickly upgrade their bike’s safety without complicated modifications. Whether for daily rides or high-speed touring, the MotoCare Crash Guard delivers reliable protection, durability, and style. Product Features : Bike Compatibility: Yamaha R15 V4 Dual Slider Protection: Enhanced impact absorption Crash & Fall Protection: Safeguards engine, frame & fairings Heavy-Duty Construction: Strong and durable build Precision Fit: Designed specifically for R15 V4 Corrosion-Resistant Finish: Long-lasting performance Sleek Design: Maintains sporty aesthetics Easy Installation: Direct fit, no major modification required Compatibility : Yamaha R15 V4 (All Variants) Fits stock mounting points Suitable for daily riding & performance use6a:T647,Product Description : Ensure maximum protection for your bike with the Motocare Crash Guard with Dual Sliders for Yamaha R15 V3, designed to safeguard critical components during unexpected falls or impacts. This premium crash guard offers superior protection for your engine, frame, and fairings, making it an essential upgrade for every rider. Built with a bike-specific precision design, it fits seamlessly on the Yamaha R15 V3, maintaining the sporty aesthetics while enhancing durability. The dual slider system is strategically positioned to absorb and disperse impact forces, significantly reducing potential damage. Constructed from high-strength, heavy-duty materials, this crash guard is engineered to withstand tough riding conditions and daily use. The corrosion-resistant premium finish ensures long-lasting performance even in harsh weather. With a user-friendly installation process, the MotoCare Crash Guard can be easily mounted without complex modifications. Perfect for both city riders and highway enthusiasts, it delivers reliable safety, durability, and style. Product Features : Bike Compatibility: Yamaha R15 V3 Dual Slider Protection: Enhanced impact absorption Crash & Fall Protection: Protects engine, frame & fairings Heavy-Duty Construction: Strong and durable build Precision Fit: Designed specifically for R15 V3 Corrosion-Resistant Finish: Long-lasting durability Sporty Design: Maintains bike aesthetics Easy Installation: Direct fit, minimal tools required Compatibility : Yamaha R15 V3 (All Variants) Fits stock mounting points Suitable for daily rides & performance riding6b:T64f,Product Description : Ensure maximum protection for your bike with the Motocare Crash Guard with Dual Sliders for Yamaha MT-15, designed for riders who prioritize safety, durability, and style. This premium crash guard offers superior protection to your engine and frame during accidental drops or collisions. Engineered with a bike-specific precision fit, it integrates seamlessly with the Yamaha MT-15, maintaining the bike’s original structure and aggressive styling. The dual slider design provides enhanced impact protection by absorbing and distributing crash forces, reducing potential damage to critical components. Constructed from high-strength, heavy-duty materials, this crash guard is built to withstand harsh riding conditions and impacts. Its premium corrosion-resistant finish ensures long-lasting durability while adding a rugged, stylish look to your motorcycle. With easy installation and secure mounting, the MotoCare Crash Guard is the perfect upgrade for both city riders and touring enthusiasts looking for reliable protection and peace of mind. Product Features : Bike Compatibility: Yamaha MT-15 (All Variants) Dual Slider Protection: Enhanced impact absorption Heavy-Duty Construction: Strong and durable build Engine & Frame Safety: Protects critical bike components Precision Fit Design: Seamless integration with MT-15 Premium Finish: Corrosion and weather-resistant Stylish Look: Enhances bike aesthetics Easy Installation: Direct fit, no major modification required Compatibility : Yamaha MT-15 V1 Yamaha MT-15 V2 (BS6) Fits stock mounting points Suitable for daily riding & touring6c:T5f6,Product Description : Protect your motorcycle with confidence using the MotoCare Crash Guard with Dual Sliders for Yamaha FZ-S V3 / V4, a premium safety upgrade designed for maximum protection and durability. Engineered specifically for Yamaha FZ-S Version 3.0 and Version 4.0, this crash guard ensures a precise fit that integrates seamlessly with your bike’s frame and design. The dual slider system provides enhanced protection by absorbing impact and reducing damage to critical components during falls or collisions. Constructed from high-quality, heavy-duty materials, the MotoCare crash guard is built to withstand tough riding conditions, offering superior strength and long-lasting reliability. Its robust design helps protect the engine and bodywork while maintaining the balance and structure of your motorcycle. The premium finish not only adds a rugged and stylish look but also offers resistance against rust, corrosion, and environmental wear. With easy installation and a secure mounting system, this crash guard is an essential accessory for riders who prioritize safety without compromising on style. Product Features : Custom Fit for Yamaha FZ-S V3 & V4 Dual Sliders for Enhanced Impact Protection Heavy-Duty Crash Guard Construction Protects Engine & Key Components High-Quality Metal Build for Durability Corrosion-Resistant Premium 