 durability while resisting corrosion and environmental wear. Its dual sliders are strategically placed to minimize impact damage, providing added safety for riders tackling both urban roads and rugged trails. With easy, tool-free installation and a bike-specific design, this crash guard integrates seamlessly with your Himalayan 411’s aesthetics while enhancing its adventurous appeal. Protect your investment and ride with confidence, style, and peace of mind. Key Benefits: Engine and frame protection with dual sliders Tailor-made for Royal Enfield Himalayan 411 Durable, corrosion-resistant premium finish Red rugged design enhances off-road style Easy installation with no advanced tools required Robust construction for reliable protection in all conditions 🔧 Product Features : Type 2 Dual Slider Crash Guard with Plate – Red Provides engine and frame protection for Himalayan 411 Bike-specific design for perfect fit and integration Premium corrosion-resistant red finish Dual sliders for maximum impact protection Robust construction for off-road and urban riding Easy installation with no advanced tools required Rugged adventure-ready aesthetics43:T66d,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION : Upgrade your motorcycle protection with the Motocare Type 2 Dual Slider Crash Guard with Plate, engineered specifically for the Royal Enfield Scram 440. Built for durability and performance, this crash guard ensures maximum safety for your bike’s engine and frame during unexpected drops or impacts. Designed with precision, it seamlessly integrates with your bike’s structure while enhancing its rugged look. The dual slider system adds an extra layer of protection by absorbing impact forces and reducing potential damage. Whether you're riding through city streets or tackling rough terrains, MotoCare delivers unmatched reliability and style. PRODUCT FEATURES : Type: Dual Slider Crash Guard with Plate Material: Heavy-Duty Steel Finish: Powder-Coated (Rust Resistant) Variants: Red, Black Installation: Bolt