sh Guard is a testament to advanced engineering, featuring MIG Welding technology. This welding technique ensures seamless and robust connections between the components, enhancing overall stability and resistance against forces encountered during unforeseen incidents. Equipped with dual sliders, one on each side, this crash guard not only provides comprehensive protection to your motorcycle's vital components but also adds a touch of sleek design. The sliders are strategically placed to absorb and distribute impact forces, minimizing potential damage to your bike during accidental collisions or falls. Invest in the Moto Care Crash Guard – a fusion of strength, durability, and aesthetic appeal. Why Do Customers Love To Purchase From Us?👉 Go The Extra Mile To Serve Our Customers. We Provide Add More Value Than They Anticipate.👉 We Provide The Best Solutions Since We Are Aware Of Our Customers’ Needs.👉 Customer Satisfaction Is Our Main Priority, As Thousands Of Our Clients Attest To.👉 At The Htrz Modz, We Never Compromise On Quality. We Provide The Highest Quality Products At Unbeatable Pricing.👉 The Htrz Modz Is Dedicated To Providing High-Quality And World-Class Products And Services In Two Wheeler Industry.b6:T630,📝Product Description : Protect your motorcycle with the Motocare Crash Guard with Dual Sliders for Kawasaki Versys 300, a premium safety upgrade designed for maximum engine and frame protection. Built specifically for the Kawasaki Versys 300, this crash guard ensures superior durability and impact resistance for both city riding and long-distance touring. Engineered from high-strength steel, the dual-slider system is strategically positioned to absorb and distribute impact during accidental falls or collisions. This significantly reduces damage to critical components such as the engine, frame, and body panels. Its precision-fit design integrates seamlessly with the motorcycle’s structure, maintaining a rugged yet factory-style appearance. The corrosion-resistant premium finish ensures long-lasting performance even in harsh weather and road conditions. With an easy bolt-on installation system, this crash guard is a must-have upgrade for riders who prioritize safety, durability, and style. ✅ Product Features : ✔️ Dual Slider Impact Protection System – Reduces crash damage ✔️ Engine & Frame Protection – Shields critical motorcycle parts ✔️ Heavy-Duty Steel Construction – Built for maximum durability ✔️ Custom Fit for Versys 300 – OEM-style precision design ✔️ Corrosion-Resistant Finish – Weatherproof long-lasting coating ✔️ Rugged Styling Upgrade – Enhances adventure bike aesthetics ✔️ Maintains Ride Balance & Clearance – No handling compromise ✔️ Easy Installation – Bolt-on setup, no modifications requiredb7:T617,🧲 PRODUCT DESCRIPTION : Upgrade your bike’s safety with the Motoacre Type 2 4 Slider Crash Guard for TVS Apache RTR 200, engineered for riders who demand superior protection and rugged performance. This premium crash guard is designed to protect your motorcycle during unexpected falls, collisions, and rough road conditions. Built with a high-strength metal frame and four impact-absorbing sliders, this guard provides enhanced protection for both the engine and bodywork. The dual-side slider system ensures complete coverage of upper and lower sections, reducing damage during accidents. Its precision custom-fit design ensures seamless compatibility with the Apache RTR 200 while maintaining a clean, factory-style look. Whether you're navigating city traffic or exploring off-road terrain, this crash guard delivers dependable safety and durability. With easy installation and Motoacre’s trusted build quality, this is the perfect upgrade for riders who prioritize safety, performance, and style. ⚙️ PRODUCT FEATURES : ✔ Custom-designed for TVS Apache RTR 200 (Type 2 Fitment) ✔ Advanced 4-slider crash protection system ✔ Dual-side impact protection (upper + lower engine zones) ✔ Heavy-duty reinforced metal construction ✔ Designed to reduce damage during falls and collisions ✔ Scratch and impact-resistant rugged build ✔ Easy bolt-on installation (no modifications required) ✔ Stylish design that enhances bike aesthetics ✔ Ideal for city riding, touring & off-road use ✔ Long-lasting durability with Motoacre assuranceb8:T63c,📝Product Description : Protect your motorcycle with the Motocare Crash Guard with Dual Sliders for Kawasaki Z 650, a premium safety upgrade designed for maximum protection, durability, and performance. Built specifically for the Kawasaki Z 650, this crash guard ensures superior safety for your engine, frame, and critical components. Engineered from high-strength materials, the dual-slider system is strategically positioned to absorb and distribute impact during falls or collisions. This reduces damage significantly and helps prevent costly repairs, making it an essential upgrade for both city riders and touring enthusiasts. Its precision-fit design integrates seamlessly with the motorcycle’s frame, maintaining a sporty and aggressive look without compromising ground clearance or handling. The premium corrosion-resistant finish ensures long-lasting durability even in harsh riding conditions. With a simple bolt-on installation, this crash guard is easy to mount and offers instant protection for your bike. ✅ Product Features : ✔️ Dual Slider Impact Protection – Reduces damage during falls ✔️ Engine & Frame Safety – Protects critical motorcycle components ✔️ Heavy-Duty Construction – Built for long-lasting durability ✔️ Custom Fit for Kawasaki Z 650 – OEM-style precision design ✔️ Corrosion-Resistant Finish – Weatherproof and durable ✔️ Rugged Aesthetic Upgrade – Enhances bike’s aggressive look ✔️ Maintains Ground Clearance – No compromise on ride quality ✔️ Easy Installation – Bolt-on setup, no modifications requiredb9:T633,📝Product Description : Protect your motorcycle with the Motocare Crash Guard with Dual Sliders for Kawasaki W175, a premium safety upgrade designed for strength, stability, and long-lasting protection. Built specifically for the Kawasaki W175, this crash guard ensures maximum safety for your engine, frame, and critical components. Engineered from high-strength steel, the dual-slider system is strategically positioned to absorb and distribute impact during accidental falls or collisions. This significantly reduces damage and helps protect expensive bike components from repair costs. Its precision-fit design integrates perfectly with the motorcycle’s structure, maintaining a clean factory-like appearance while enhancing rugged styling. The corrosion-resistant finish ensures durability in all weather conditions, making it ideal for daily commuting and city riding. With an easy bolt-on installation, this crash guard is a practical and essential upgrade for every W175 rider who values safety and style. ✅ Product Features : ✔️ Dual Slider Impact Protection System – Reduces fall damage ✔️ Engine & Frame Protection – Shields critical bike components ✔️ Heavy-Duty Steel Construction – Built for long-term durability ✔️ Custom Fit for Kawasaki W175 – OEM-style precision design ✔️ Corrosion-Resistant Finish – Weatherproof and long-lasting ✔️ Rugged Styling Upgrade – Enhances motorcycle aesthetics ✔️ Maintains Ride Balance – No impact on handling or clearance ✔️ Easy Installation – Bolt-on setup, no modifications neededba:T6b2,📝Product Description : Protect your bike with confidence using the Motocare Lower Crash Guard for BMW G 310 R, engineered for maximum safety, durability, and style. Designed specifically for the BMW G 310 R, this heavy-duty crash guard shields critical components like the engine, exhaust, and frame during unexpected drops or low-speed impacts. Built from high-quality materials, the crash guard features a corrosion-resistant finish available in Black, Silver, and Red—giving your motorcycle both rugged protection and a premium look. Its precision design ensures seamless integration with the bike’s structure, maintaining factory aesthetics without compromising performance. The intelligently engineered structure absorbs and disperses impact energy, reducing potential damage and minimizing repair costs. Despite its robust build, it maintains optimal ground clearance and does not interfere with handling, making it ideal for both city rides and long-distance touring. With an easy bolt-on installation process, upgrading your bike’s protection has never been simpler. ✅ Product Features : ✔️ Engine & Frame Protection – Safeguards vital components during crashes ✔️ Heavy-Duty Construction – Built with high-strength materials for durability ✔️ Impact Absorption Design – Reduces damage in case of falls or collisions ✔️ Corrosion-Resistant Finish – Long-lasting Black, Silver & Red coating ✔️ Maintains Ground Clearance – No compromise on riding performance ✔️ Seamless Fit – Designed specifically for BMW G 310 R ✔️ Easy Installation – Direct bolt-on with minimal tools required ✔️ Rugged Aesthetic Upgrade – Enhances the bike’s aggressive lookbb:T61a,📝 Product Description : Protect your motorcycle with the Motocare Crash Guard with Dual Sliders for BMW G 310 R, a premium safety upgrade designed for strength, durability, and performance. Engineered specifically for the BMW G 310 R, this crash guard provides maximum protection for your engine, frame, and critical components. Built from high-strength materials, the dual-slider system is strategically positioned to absorb and distribute impact during falls or collisions, significantly reducing damage to your motorcycle. The reinforced structure ensures long-lasting durability while maintaining optimal balance and ground clearance. Designed for seamless integration, the crash guard enhances your bike’s rugged appearance without compromising style or performance. Its corrosion-resistant finish ensures long-term protection against weather and road conditions. With an easy bolt-on installation process, this upgrade is perfect for riders who want superior protection with minimal effort. ✅ Product Features : ✔️ Dual Slider Protection System – Enhanced impact absorption ✔️ Engine & Frame Safety – Protects critical motorcycle components ✔️ Heavy-Duty Construction – Built for maximum durability ✔️ Custom Fit for BMW G 310 R – Perfect OEM-style integration ✔️ Corrosion-Resistant Finish – Long-lasting performance ✔️ Rugged Aesthetic Upgrade – Adds aggressive styling ✔️ Easy Installation – Bolt-on design, no modifications required ✔️ Maintains Ground Clearance – No compromise on riding dynamicsbc:T4bb,📝PRODUCT DESCRIPTION : Upgrade the safety and style of your Bajaj Pulsar NS200 with the MotoCare Crash Guard featuring 4 heavy-duty sliders. Designed for riders who demand both protection and performance, this crash guard minimizes damage during accidental falls while enhancing your bike’s rugged appeal. Built with premium-grade materials, the MotoCare crash guard ensures long-lasting durability across city rides and highway adventures. Its precision-engineered design guarantees a perfect fit without compromising your bike’s original structure. Whether you're commuting daily or exploring tough terrains, this crash guard offers superior engine and body protection—keeping your ride safe and stylish. ⭐ PRODUCT FEATURES : ✅ Custom Fit for Pulsar NS200 – Perfect alignment with factory mounting points ✅ 4-Slider Protection System – Dual sliders on each side for maximum coverage ✅ Heavy-Duty Build Quality – Rust-resistant, impact-absorbing construction ✅ Engine & Body Protection – Reduces damage during crashes or falls ✅ Easy Bolt-On Installation – No major modifications required ✅ Sporty Red Finish – Enhances aggressive street look ✅ Ideal for City & Touring Usebd:T5cc,Evotech Performance Engine Guard – Ducati Scrambler / Monster 797 Protect your Ducati Scrambler or Monster 797 with Evotech Performance Engine Guards. Designed for maximum coverage while allowing airflow, these guards attach directly to existing mounting points on your motorcycle without the need for modifications. Product Features Secures directly to existing bike mounting points—no modifications required. Unique design allows airflow while maintaining high-level engine protection. CNC-machined from aircraft-quality aluminium for strength and durability. Durable black powder-coated finish for longevity. Compatibility Ducati Scrambler Icon (2019+) Ducati Scrambler Full Throttle (2015–2021) Ducati Scrambler Icon Dark (2020–2022) Ducati Scrambler Nightshift (2021+) Ducati Scrambler Desert Sled (2019+) Ducati Scrambler Urban Motard (2022+) Ducati Scrambler Desert Sled Fasthouse (2021–2022) Ducati Scrambler Urban Enduro (2015–2016) Ducati Scrambler Icon (2015–2018) Ducati Monster 796 (2010–2016) Ducati Scrambler Cafe Racer (2017–2021) Ducati Scrambler Classic (2019–2020) Ducati Scrambler Street Classic (2018–2020) Ducati Scrambler Mach 2.0 (2017–2020) Ducati Scrambler Desert Sled (2017–2018) Ducati Scrambler Flat Tracker Pro (2016) Ducati Scrambler Italia Independent (2016) Ducati Scrambler Classic (2015–2018) Ducati Monster 797 (2017–2020) Ducati Monster 797+ (2018–2020) Ducati Monster 795 (2012–2018) Part Number PRN012330-012331be:T691,Evotech Performance Spindle Bobbins Kit For BMW R 1250 GS / GSA / Rallye Part Number: PRN012816-014487 Evotech Performance Spindle Bobbins provide essential crash protection for your BMW R 1250 GS / GSA / Rallye. The front bobbins guard the fork lowers and brake callipers, while the rear bobbin protects the cardan drive shaft. Front protection is installed using a supplied stainless steel spindle with rolled threads and a replacement hollow spindle bolt. The rear protection is mounted via a precision cassette-style aluminium hub with an O-ring for water protection. Injection-moulded nylon bobbins with aluminium cores reduce costly damage by acting sacrificially in an impact. Features Double-sided front wheel protection with rear wheel nearside protection. Discreet black injection-moulded nylon bobbins with aluminium support. Front protection is fixed using a rolled-thread stainless steel spindle rod. Front replacement hollow spindle bolt with all required fastenings included. Rear cassette-style mounting with O-ring to prevent water ingress to the wheel hub. Produced from engineering-grade materials by Evotech Performance. Compatibility BMW R 1250 GS Rallye (2019+) BMW R 1250 GS Adventure Rallye TE (2019+) BMW R 1250 GS Adventure Exclusive TE (2019+) BMW R 1250 GS Adventure (2019+) BMW R 1250 GS Adventure - Edition 40 Years GS (2021+) BMW R 1250 GS Edition 40 Years GS (2021+) BMW R 1250 GS (2019+) BMW R 1250 GS TE (2019+) BMW R 1250 GS Rallye TE (2019+) BMW R 1250 GS Exclusive TE (2019+) BMW R 1250 GS Adventure TE (2019+) BMW R 1200 GS (2013-2018) BMW R 1200 GS Rallye (2017-2018) BMW R 1200 GS Exclusive TE (2017-2018) BMW R 1200 GS Adventure (2013-2018)24:[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://iranimotohub.in\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Crash Guards\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://iranimotohub.in/collections/crash-guards\\\"}]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"$L2d\",null,{\"handle\":\"crash-guards\",\"initialCollection\":{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Collection/555262509373\",\"handle\":\"crash-guards\",\"title\":\"Crash Guards\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/collections/CRASHGUARDWHITE_jpg.jpg?v=1787079909\",\"altText\":\"Crash Guards\"}},\"initialCollections\":[{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Collection/555260772669\",\"handle\":\"air-filters\",\"title\":\"Air Filters\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/collections/air-filter-bike.png?v=1787078101\