scription : Protect your motorcycle with confidence using the Motocare 4 Slider Crash Guard, specially designed for Bajaj Pulsar N160 and Bajaj Pulsar F250. Engineered for maximum protection, this crash guard features four strategically placed sliders to reduce impact damage during falls or collisions. Built with high-quality, durable materials, it safeguards critical components like the engine and body panels, making it an essential upgrade for both city riders and long-distance tourers. The dual-side slider configuration ensures complete coverage for upper and lower sections of your bike. With a precision-fit design and easy installation, this crash guard seamlessly integrates with your motorcycle while enhancing its rugged and sporty look. Whether you're riding in traffic or exploring tough terrains, Motocare ensures your bike stays protected. ⚙️ Product Features : 4-slider design for maximum impact protection Compatible with Bajaj Pulsar N160 & F250 Protects engine, body panels, and key components Heavy-duty construction for long-lasting durability Dual-side sliders for upper and lower protection Easy installation with secure mounting system Enhances bike safety for daily and long rides Rugged and stylish design upgrade Suitable for city and touring use88:T5f9,🧾 Product Description : Protect your motorcycle with confidence using the Motocare 4 Slider Crash Guard for Bajaj Dominar 400, engineered for maximum safety, durability, and rugged styling. Designed specifically for the Dominar 400, this crash guard features four strategically positioned sliders that provide comprehensive protection for both upper and lower sections of your bike. Whether it's an accidental fall, rough terrain, or unexpected impact, this guard minimizes damage to critical components like the engine and frame. Built with high-strength materials, the Motocare crash guard ensures long-lasting durability while maintaining a lightweight structure that doesn’t affect your bike’s performance. Its 