sive styling ✔️ Easy Installation – Bolt-on design, no modifications required ✔️ Maintains Ground Clearance – No compromise on riding dynamics91:T4bb,📝PRODUCT DESCRIPTION : Upgrade the safety and style of your Bajaj Pulsar NS200 with the MotoCare Crash Guard featuring 4 heavy-duty sliders. Designed for riders who demand both protection and performance, this crash guard minimizes damage during accidental falls while enhancing your bike’s rugged appeal. Built with premium-grade materials, the MotoCare crash guard ensures long-lasting durability across city rides and highway adventures. Its precision-engineered design guarantees a perfect fit without compromising your bike’s original structure. Whether you're commuting daily or exploring tough terrains, this crash guard offers superior engine and body protection—keeping your ride safe and stylish. ⭐ PRODUCT FEATURES : ✅ Custom Fit for Pulsar NS200 – Perfect alignment with factory mounting points ✅ 4-Slider Protection System – Dual sliders on each side for maximum coverage ✅ Heavy-Duty Build Quality – Rust-resistant, impact-absorbing construction ✅ Engine & Body Protection – Reduces damage during crashes or falls ✅ Easy Bolt-On Installation – No major modifications required ✅ Sporty Red Finish – Enhances aggressive street look ✅ Ideal for City & Touring Use92:T5cc,Evotech Performance Engine Guard – Ducati Scrambler / Monster 797 Protect your Ducati Scrambler or Monster 797 with Evotech Performance Engine Guards. Designed for maximum coverage while allowing airflow, these guards attach directly to existing mounting points on your motorcycle without the need for modifications. Product Features Secures directly to existing bike mounting points—no modifications required. Unique design allows airflow while maintaining high-level engine protection. CNC-machined from aircraft-quality aluminium for strength and durability. Durable black powder-coated finish for longevity. Compatibility Ducati Scrambler Icon (2019+) Ducati Scrambler Full Throttle (2015–2021) Ducati Scrambler Icon Dark (2020–2022) Ducati Scrambler Nightshift (2021+) Ducati Scrambler Desert Sled (2019+) Ducati Scrambler Urban Motard (2022+) Ducati Scrambler Desert Sled Fasthouse (2021–2022) Ducati Scrambler Urban Enduro (2015–2016) Ducati Scrambler Icon (2015–2018) Ducati Monster 796 (2010–2016) Ducati Scrambler Cafe Racer (2017–2021) Ducati Scrambler Classic (2019–2020) Ducati Scrambler Street Classic (2018–2020) Ducati Scrambler Mach 2.0 (2017–2020) Ducati Scrambler Desert Sled (2017–2018) Ducati Scrambler Flat Tracker Pro (2016) Ducati Scrambler Italia Independent (2016) Ducati Scrambler Classic (2015–2018) Ducati Monster 797 (2017–2020) Ducati Monster 797+ (2018–2020) Ducati Monster 795 (2012–2018) Part Number PRN012330-01233193:T691,Evotech Performance Spindle Bobbins Kit For BMW R 1250 GS / GSA / Rallye Part Number: PRN012816-014487 Evotech Performance Spindle Bobbins provide essential crash protection for your BMW R 1250 GS / GSA / Rallye. The front bobbins guard the fork lowers and brake callipers, while the rear bobbin protects the cardan drive shaft. Front protection is installed using a supplied stainless steel spindle with rolled threads and a replacement hollow spindle bolt. The rear protection is mounted via a precision cassette-style aluminium hub with an O-ring for water protection. Injection-moulded nylon bobbins with aluminium cores reduce costly damage by acting sacrificially in an impact. Features Double-sided front wheel protection with rear wheel nearside protection. Discreet black injection-moulded nylon bobbins with aluminium support. Front protection is fixed using a rolled-thread stainless steel spindle rod. Front replacement hollow spindle bolt with all required fastenings included. Rear cassette-style mounting with O-ring to prevent water ingress to the wheel hub. Produced from engineering-grade materials by Evotech Performance. Compatibility BMW R 1250 GS Rallye (2019+) BMW R 1250 GS Adventure Ra